  nodeId: PV - Page 1
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "<b>Visuals</b>\r\nThe Investigator focuses intently on the clean dust
    outline on the pedestal. A glowing, translucent vase materializes over the empty
    spot. An ornate pocket watch fades into the foreground\u2014its second hand stutters,
    pauses, and then spins violently backward.\r\n\r\n<b>Narrative / Audio</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n
    \r\n\r\n<i>No. of Panels: 5</i>\r\n<i>1. Focus on pedestal</i>\r\n<i>2. Clock
    fading into foreground</i>\r\n<i>3. Second hand slowing down</i>\r\n<i>4. Second
    hand pausing</i>\r\n<i>5. Second spining backward</i>\r\n\r"
